# Boomerang Basics: "Return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand. If you controlled that permanent, draw a card."
# Bot1 takes Bot2's Mox Pearl with Dack Fayden (-2), controls it, and bounces it: it goes to its owner Bot2's hand (not
# Bot1's), and Bot1, who controlled it, draws. Bot1 holds 2 cards while the Boomerang is on the stack and 3 after the draw.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Dack Fayden
Boomerang Basics
Plains
Plains x2
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Plains x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dack Fayden.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dack Fayden.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl; Ability: Gain control)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Boomerang Basics.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl)
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 2
[T3 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot2.Hand.Count = 8
Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
Bot1.Battlefield = Dack Fayden; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Mox Sapphire; Mox Sapphire
